@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@aliceOwnId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@bobId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@bobSearchId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@comment1 = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@comment2 = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@comment3 = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Alice login; REST Client reads process environment
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Own details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Foreign details with the same Alice cookie
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### List, summary and search as Alice
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/search?q=O%27Brien
Accept: application/json

### Foreign update with the same Alice cookie
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "PoC changed by Alice", "description": "Text replaced from the Alice account during the PoC.", "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-02T14:10:00Z" }

### Reporter calls privileged triage on foreign incident
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}/triage

### Foreign delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobSearchId}}

### Child comment of Bob incident
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{comment2}}
Accept: application/json

### Internal comment on own incident
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{comment3}}
Accept: application/json

### Bob login changes current identity
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "bob", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Own details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Morgan login; Analyst read
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "morgan", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Permitted Analyst read
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Permitted Analyst triage of a New incident
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceOwnId}}/triage

### Analyst reads internal comment
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{comment3}}
Accept: application/json